2. Fixed Isabelle2025 reference and upstream excerpts
----------------------------------------------------

Scope: the optional isabelle-source/ checkout, upstream source lines retained
in scripts/reference/instrumentation/*.patch, and other copied or adapted
material from that checkout. The patches contain project-authored observation
changes to the indicated upstream files; the upstream material retains its
applicable terms. Assess reference tools by their actual contents and sources,
not merely by whether they call Isabelle APIs. Retain applicable upstream
notices when copying or adapting files; this summary does not replace
component-specific terms.
