3. Cargo dependencies and native libraries
-----------------------------------------

Dependencies retain their own licenses and copyright notices. Cargo.lock
records resolved Rust packages; deny.toml records the project's dependency
license policy, not a replacement license or a redistribution notice bundle.
Actual native library selection may also depend on build configuration.

This file is not an exhaustive dependency license inventory. Before
redistributing a binary, include the applicable license texts and notices
for its actual dependencies and bundled native components. A successful
cargo-deny check alone does not establish redistribution compliance.
